title: loadPhase
---
<<if ratQuestIsComplete()>>
    <<jump AfterReward>>
<<elseif ratQuestCanTurnIn()>>
    <<jump TurnIn>>
<<elseif ratQuestIsActive()>>
    <<jump ActiveQuest>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Start>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Homeowner: You! Pest-control person! Thank goodness. Something screamed in my house.
Homeowner: It may have been me. It was probably me. The rats are judging me.
-> When did you first see them?
    <<jump AskedWhen>>
-> How many rats are there?
    <<jump AskedHowMany>>
-> Why were you screaming?
    <<jump AskedWhy>>
-> Tell me what you need.
    <<jump OfferQuest>>
===
title: AskedWhen
---
Homeowner: Three nights ago. Or three weeks. Time bends when twelve tiny eyes become twenty-four.
Homeowner: They came from the backyard and started scratching under the walls.
<<jump Questions>>
===
title: AskedHowMany
---
Homeowner: Twelve. Exactly twelve. I counted them twice, then counted myself by mistake.
Homeowner: Catch all 12. Not eleven. Eleven is how they trick you.
<<jump Questions>>
===
title: AskedWhy
---
Homeowner: One touched my shoe. Very calmly. Like it owned the deed to the house.
Homeowner: I made a professional, controlled scream. Please stop looking at me like that.
<<jump Questions>>
===
title: Questions
---
-> Ask another question.
    -> When did you first see them?
        <<jump AskedWhen>>
    -> How many rats are there?
        <<jump AskedHowMany>>
    -> Why were you screaming?
        <<jump AskedWhy>>
-> Hear the job offer.
    <<jump OfferQuest>>
===
title: OfferQuest
---
Homeowner: Go back to the backyard and catch all 12 rats. They run when you get close.
Homeowner: Bring me peace and I will pay 100 coins. Real coins. Mostly real.
-> Accept the job.
    <<acceptRatQuest NPC>>
    Homeowner: Good. Catch all 12, then come back. Do not let them unionize.
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
-> Maybe later.
    Homeowner: Later? They are learning the locks! Fine. Come back before they learn taxes.
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
title: ActiveQuest
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Homeowner: That is not twelve. I can still hear the uncaught ones planning.
Homeowner: Please finish the backyard before my furniture changes sides.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
title: TurnIn
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Homeowner: Silence. Beautiful, suspicious silence. You caught all 12!
Homeowner: Here are your 100 coins. Take them before I remember rent exists.
<<rewardRatQuest NPC>>
Homeowner: The job is complete. If anything else squeaks, I am moving.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
title: AfterReward
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Homeowner: You already saved me, and I already paid you.
Homeowner: No second reward. I wrote it on my hand. See? Very official.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
